    "body": "Removed the rejected standalone dictionary entirely. There is no `lex_blips.ytd` left in the active source tree, disabled/quarantine directory, build output, game loader path, or game mod-storage folder. I also removed both standalone build scripts and their private YTD builder binaries so the bad archive cannot be regenerated by the normal project workflow. The 13 icon DDS inputs now live under `build_resident_map_icons/dds` and feed only the complete working `INVENTORY_ITEMS_MP` replacement. Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#245 verification now fails if any deleted archive or builder reappears.",
